    "Id": "mechdef_catapult_ii_CPLT-L7L",
    "Name": "Catapult II CPLT-L7L",
    "Details": "The Catapult II retains the original's movement, jump capabilities and has a half ton more armor protection than its predecessor. Introduced a year after the base model in 3136, the advanced L7L is designed as a more conventional Capellan design with enhanced armor. The 'Mech trades in all its base weaponry for two Plasma Rifles mounted in each of the side torsos, and two 9-tube Multi-Missile Launchers. The design's most noted feature is its Heat-Dissipating Armor, which offers the variant greater resistance to heat related attacks.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Accurate Weapon - Missiles</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.1</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
    "Icon": "CatapultIIC"
  },
